    },
    {
      "type": "code_block",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "```text\nBit 7 = 0  5 bit correction span (default value)\n      = 1  11 bit correction span\n\nBit 6 = 0  Retries & ECC enabled (default value)\n      = 1  Retries & ECC disabled\n\nBit 5 = 0  Not Used\n\nBit 4 = 0  Not Used\n```",
